# Replaces stow's default ignore list for this package only.
# `herdr config reset-keys` drops config.toml.bak-keybind-v2-<epoch> beside the
# config; without this, stow would symlink that stray backup into ~/.config/herdr.
# Patterns are Perl regexes anchored at BOTH ends and matched per path segment,
# so a bare `\.bak.*$` would never match `config.toml.bak-...` — hence `.*`.
.*\.bak.*
\.stow-local-ignore
